              <span>Shipping & Delivery</span>
              <span class="transition group-open:-rotate-180">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#2C221E]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div class="mt-3 text-[#55473E] leading-relaxed">
              <p>• Every outfit is made to order and dispatched within {{ dispatch_days }} business days.</p>
              <p>• India: delivered in 4-7 business days after dispatch.</p>
              <p>• International: we ship worldwide &mdash; delivered in 10-15 business days after dispatch.</p>
              <p>• You will receive a tracking link by email once your order is dispatched.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-[#EADCD0]/40 rounded-xl border border-[#DFCDC0] p-4 [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#2C221E]">
              <span>Returns &amp; Exchanges</span>
              <span class="transition group-open:-rotate-180">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#2C221E]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div class="mt-3 text-[#55473E] leading-relaxed">
              <p>• We do not accept returns or exchanges on any product.</p>
              <p>• As every outfit is made to order, please check the <button type="button" data-size-chart-link class="underline underline-offset-2 font-semibold text-[#2C221E]">size chart</button> or message us on WhatsApp before ordering &mdash; we are happy to help you pick the right size.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Customer Reviews -->
    <div id="reviews" class="mt-20 border-t border-[#DFCDC0] pt-14 space-y-6 scroll-mt-28">
      <div class="text-center space-y-2">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#7A6B60] font-sans font-medium">What Parents Say</span>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-[#2C221E] font-normal">Customer Reviews</h2>
      </div>
      {%- comment -%} Judge.me (free reviews app) renders its widget here once installed {%- endcomment -%}
      <div id="judgeme_product_reviews" class="jdgm-widget jdgm-review-widget max-w-4xl mx-auto" data-id="{{ product.id }}">
        {{ product.metafields.judgeme.widget }}
      </div>
      {%- if product.metafields.judgeme.widget == blank -%}
        <div class="max-w-xl mx-auto text-center bg-[#FAF7F2]/80 border border-[#DFCDC0] rounded-2xl p-8 space-y-2 font-sans">
          <p class="font-serif text-xl text-[#2C221E]">No reviews yet</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#7A6B60]">Bought this outfit? We would love to hear from you &mdash; share your photos and review with us on WhatsApp or Instagram.</p>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    <!-- Related Recommendations Section -->
    <div class="mt-20 border-t border-[#DFCDC0] pt-14 space-y-8">
      <div class="text-center space-y-2">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#7A6B60] font-sans font-medium">Curated For You</span>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-[#2C221E] font-normal">You May Also Love</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 sm:gap-6">
        {% if recommendations.products_count > 0 %}
          {% for recommendation in recommendations.products limit: 4 %}
            {% render 'product-card', product: recommendation %}
          {% endfor %}
        {% else %}
          {% for product in collections.all.products limit: 4 %}
            {% render 'product-card', product: product %}
          {% endfor %}
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
